@startuml uc-pat-01-comm-alt-a7
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8

title UC-PAT-01: Manage My Appointments (C5 v1.1.0)\nCommunication Diagram - Alternative Flow A7: Appointment Executed or Already Cancelled

actor ":Patient" as pat
boundary ":MyAppointmentsUI" as ui
control ":PatientAppointmentController" as ctrl
control ":PatientAppointmentService" as srv
control ":AccessControlService (C1)" as c1
entity ":Booking" as booking
control ":PendingOrderGateway (C4)" as c4
control ":ExamTypeService (C2)" as c2e
entity ":RescheduleRequest" as req
control ":AppointmentRules" as rules
control ":AuditService (C1)" as audit

pat -- ui : 1: selectAppointment(bookingId)\n6: [stale page] chooseConfirm() or confirmCancellation(reason) >\n< 5: displayStatusWithActionsDisabled(EXECUTED or CANCELLED)\n< 11: displayCurrentStatus(EXECUTED or CANCELLED)

ui -- ctrl : 2: GET my-appointments/{bookingId}\n7: POST my-appointments/{bookingId}/confirm or /cancel >\n< 4: HTTP 200 (AppointmentDetailsDTO, allowedActions = [])\n< 10: HTTP 409 (REQUEST_ALREADY_PROCESSED)

ctrl -- srv : 3: getAppointmentDetails(bookingId, actorId, role)\n8: confirmAppointment(...) or cancelAppointment(...) >\n< 9: throw RequestAlreadyProcessedException

srv -- c1 : 3.1: canManageOwnAppointments(actorId, role)\n8.1: canManageOwnAppointments(actorId, role) >

srv -- booking : 3.2: isOwnedBy(actorId)\n8.2: isOwnedBy(actorId) >

srv -- c4 : 3.3: findByOrderId(orderId) >

srv -- c2e : 3.4: getActiveExamType(examTypeCode) >

srv -- req : 3.5: findPending(bookingId) >

srv -- rules : 3.6: allowedActions(booking, pendingRequest, now) -> []\n8.3: checkConfirm(...) or checkCancel(...) -> [REQUEST_ALREADY_PROCESSED] >

srv -- audit : 3.7: recordEvent(APPOINTMENT_DETAILS_VIEWED)\n8.4: recordEvent(APPOINTMENT_ACTION_REJECTED, REQUEST_ALREADY_PROCESSED) >

note bottom of rules
  EXECUTED and CANCELLED are final: no action is allowed.
  If the booking version changed meanwhile (e.g. Admissions
  rescheduled it in UC-AAD-05): 409 CONCURRENT_BOOKING, as in AAD-05.
end note
@enduml
